flowchart TB
accTitle: Retire a daily table only after the archive is complete
accDescr: New writes move to the prepared next-day table, while the prior table is exported and checked for late writes before deletion.
P[Prepare next daily table]:::process --> N[(New daily table receives writes)]:::storage
P --> O[(Prior daily table)]:::storage
O --> E[Export required raw data to S3]:::process
E --> C{Export verified and late writes reconciled?}:::decision
C -->|No| K[Retain table and complete archive]:::warning
K --> E
C -->|Yes| D[Delete retired daily table]:::output
B[Reserve the continuously used capacity baseline]:::reference -.-> N
